<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Asantha Sigera - Travel portfolio. Travel.">
  <title>Asantha Sigera | Tourist</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0b0f0e;
      --text: #f5f3ed;
      --muted: #b8b9b2;
      --accent: #d8b56a;
      --card: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,.14);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.35), rgba(0,0,0,.72)),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=85")
        center/cover;
    }
    .hero-content { max-width: 900px; }
    .eyebrow {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .35em;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: .8rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 10vw, 8rem);
      line-height: .95;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .title {
      font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 2rem);
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .tagline {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      font-weight: 300;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }
    .buttons { display: flex; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn {
      padding: 13px 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      transition: .25s;
    }
    .btn.primary { background: var(--text); color: #111; }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
    section { padding: 100px 7%; max-width: 1300px; margin: auto; }
    .section-label {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .2em;
      font-size: .75rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    h2 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem); margin-bottom: 25px; }
    .about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center; }
    .about p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 15px; }
    .stat, .card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 28px;
    }
    .stat strong { display: block; font-size: 2.5rem; }
    .stat span { color: var(--muted); }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
    .card img { width: calc(100% + 56px); margin: -28px -28px 22px; height: 230px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 22px 22px 0 0; }
    .card h3 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .card p { color: var(--muted); }
    footer {
      padding: 50px 7%;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .about, .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      section { padding: 70px 6%; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="eyebrow">Personal Travel Portfolio</div>
      <h1>Asantha Sigera</h1>
      <div class="title">Tourist</div>
      <div class="tagline">Travel.</div>
      <div class="buttons">
        <a class="btn primary" href="#journeys">Explore My Journey</a>
        <a class="btn" href="#contact">Contact Me</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section id="about">
      <div class="about">
        <div>
          <div class="section-label">About Me</div>
          <h2>Go somewhere. Experience something.</h2>
          <p>
            I'm Asantha, a curious traveler who loves discovering new places,
            experiencing different cultures, meeting people, and collecting
            memories along the way.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stat"><strong>15+</strong><span>Destinations</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><strong>10+</strong><span>Cities Explored</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><strong>100+</strong><span>Memories</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><strong>∞</strong><span>Adventures</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="journeys">
      <div class="section-label">My Journeys</div>
      <h2>Places I've explored</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524492412937-b28074a5d7da?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="Travel destination">
          <h3>Journey One</h3>
          <p>Add your destination, travel date, story and highlights here.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507525428034-b723cf961d3e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="Beach destination">
          <h3>Journey Two</h3>
          <p>Add another memorable destination and your personal story.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="Mountain destination">
          <h3>Journey Three</h3>
          <p>Share the experience, adventure and moments you discovered.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="destinations">
      <div class="section-label">Destinations</div>
      <h2>Discovering the world</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card"><h3>Asia</h3><p>Add your favorite Asian destinations here.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Nature</h3><p>Mountains, forests, waterfalls and unforgettable landscapes.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Cities</h3><p>Explore the places, streets, food and culture of new cities.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="photography">
      <div class="section-label">Photography</div>
      <h2>Moments worth remembering</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500534623283-312aade485b7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="Travel photograph"><h3>Moment One</h3></div>
        <div class="card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500534314209-a25ddb2bd429?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="Landscape photograph"><h3>Moment Two</h3></div>
        <div class="card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470770841072-f978cf4d019e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="Nature photograph"><h3>Moment Three</h3></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="stories">
      <div class="section-label">Travel Stories</div>
      <h2>Stories from the road</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card"><h3>My First Journey</h3><p>Write your first travel story here.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>The Road Less Traveled</h3><p>Share an adventure that was different from the usual path.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Discovering Somewhere New</h3><p>Tell the story behind one of your favorite destinations.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <div class="section-label">Contact</div>
      <h2>Where should I go next?</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:25px;">
        Have a destination, story, or adventure to share? Get in touch.
      </p>
      <a class="btn primary" href="mailto:your@email.com">Email Me</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Asantha Sigera · Travel.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
